>
<Nav /><section class="section hero mint-blue tools"><div class="container__01"><div class="hero-wrapper align-top"><div class="hero-content margin-top"><h1 class="h1-heading">Success Stories</h1><div class="hero-paragraph-title">Inspiring stories of justice and compensation.</div><p class="paragraph__19 margin-64">Inspiring success stories of clients who received justice and compensation with the dedicated representation of TBW Law Firm. Discover how our expertise in personal injury law has positively impacted lives.</p></div><div class="hero-image-wrapper hero-image-45"><img src="/images/ss_01.jpg" loading="lazy" width="559" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 80vw, 40vw" alt="" srcset="/images/ss_01-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/ss_01.jpg 560w" class="hero-image"><div class="absolute-image-wrapper animate"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section content-12"><div class="container__01"><div class="flexbox-wrapper c-left"><div class="content-wrapper width-42"><h2 class="h2-heading margin-15">Koganti Wins $15,990,000 Against PODS</h2><p class="paragraph margin-40">Karteek was traveling with five friends on a road trip across the United States when an 18-wheeler struck their van on a Pennsylvania highway. The truck driver, distracted while retrieving a fallen headset, failed to stop for slowed traffic in a construction zone. <br><br>The collision propelled the van forward into another vehicle and a U-Haul truck, leaving Karteek with critical injuries and rendering him an incomplete paraplegic.<br><br></p></div><div class="video-image-wrapper"><img src="/images/koganti_1.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, (max-width: 991px) 80vw, 46vw" srcset="/images/koganti_1-p-500.png 500w, /images/koganti_1.png 600w" alt="" class="video-image"><a href="#" class="video-button-wrapper inline-block lightbox-link" aria-label="open lightbox" aria-haspopup="dialog"><img src="/images/Group-49.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="video-button-icon">