      "height": 528,
      "thumbnailUrl": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/cCBH7VgbV-0/hqdefault.jpg",
      "html": "<iframe class=\"embedly-embed\" src=\"//cdn.embedly.com/widgets/media.html?src=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fembed%2FcCBH7VgbV-0%3Ffeature%3Doembed&display_name=YouTube&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DcCBH7VgbV-0&image=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2FcCBH7VgbV-0%2Fhqdefault.jpg&type=text%2Fhtml&schema=youtube\" width=\"940\" height=\"528\" scrolling=\"no\" title=\"YouTube embed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture;\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>",
      "type": "video"
    }
  ],
  "group": ""
}</script></a></div><div class="content-wrapper width-40 right"><h2 class="h2-heading">Condon Family Receives $7 Million Dollars for Injuries.</h2><p class="paragraph">TBW Law successfully secured justice for Mr. Condon, who suffered a below-the-knee amputation after a motorcycle accident, initially marked by completely adverse liability in the police report. <br><br>In spite of significant challenges, TBW Law meticulously proved the defendant's negligence, ensuring substantial compensation to support Mr. Condon's recovery and future needs.</p></div></div></section><section class="section content-13"><div class="container__01"><div class="flexbox-wrapper c-left"><div class="content-wrapper width-42"><h2 class="h2-heading margin-15">$12.5 Million Dollar Win for the Hernandez Family.</h2><p class="paragraph margin-40">Attorney Ted Wacker of TBW Law secured a $12.65 million settlement for a college soccer player severely injured by a speeding semi-truck. The accident occurred on I-605 when the plaintiff's vehicle stalled on the highway and was struck by a reckless semi-truck driver, resulting in brain hemorrhaging and multiple fractures. <br><br>Although an initial offer of $3 million, Attorney Wacker utilized witness testimony and a detailed collision reconstruction to highlight the defendant's negligence and achieve a significantly greater settlement, ensuring justice and financial security for his client.<br><br></p></div><div class="video-image-wrapper"><img src="/images/ss3.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, (max-width: 991px) 80vw, 46vw" srcset="/images/ss3-p-500.png 500w, /images/ss3.png 515w" alt="" class="video-image"><a href="#" class="video-button-wrapper inline-block lightbox-link" aria-label="open lightbox" aria-haspopup="dialog"><img src="/images/Group-49.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="video-button-icon"><script is:inline type="application/json" class="lightbox-data">{
  "items": [
    {
