      "height": 528,
      "thumbnailUrl": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xSk16W1a734/hqdefault.jpg",
      "html": "<iframe class=\"embedly-embed\" src=\"//cdn.embedly.com/widgets/media.html?src=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fembed%2FxSk16W1a734%3Ffeature%3Doembed&display_name=YouTube&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DxSk16W1a734&image=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2FxSk16W1a734%2Fhqdefault.jpg&type=text%2Fhtml&schema=youtube\" width=\"940\" height=\"528\" scrolling=\"no\" title=\"YouTube embed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture;\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>",
      "type": "video"
    }
  ],
  "group": ""
}</script></a></div><div class="content-wrapper width-40 right"><h2 class="h2-heading">Baker Family Wins $8 Million in Lawsuit Against Vans</h2><p class="paragraph">Mr. Baker was riding his motorcycle in Huntington Beach when he was struck by a van that made a sudden left turn directly in front of him. The impact caused him to be thrown from his motorcycle, resulting in a catastrophic leg injury. <br><br>He underwent seven complex surgeries in an effort to salvage his leg, enduring significant pain and a long recovery. Despite these efforts, his doctors recommended an above-the-knee amputation in the future to improve his mobility and quality of life.</p></div></div></section><section class="section content-13"><div class="container__01"><div class="flexbox-wrapper _02 c-right"><div class="content-wrapper width-40 right"><h2 class="h2-heading margin-15">Roman Family Wins $21 Million Dollars from <br>U-Haul..</h2><p class="paragraph">In a landmark victory, TBW Law secured a $21.2 million verdict for the Roman family against U-Haul. The case involved a U-Haul employee's negligent driving, which led to a head-on collision causing severe injuries to Mr. Roman. <br><br>Despite the defense's attempts to minimize damages, the jury awarded substantial compensation for pain, suffering, and medical expenses. This success exemplifies TBW Law's dedication to achieving justice for their clients.</p><a href="/blog/roman-family-awarded-21-2-million-in-u-haul-negligence-case" class="button-9 button-base">Learn More</a></div><div class="image-wrapper auto-height image-40"><img src="/images/ss2.jpg" loading="lazy" width="514" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, (max-width: 991px) 80vw, 35vw" alt="" srcset="/images/ss2-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/ss2.jpg 515w" class="image-section"></div></div></div></section><section class="section slider"><div class="container__01"><div class="center-wrapper"><h2 class="h2-heading margin-25 fade-up">Real-client success stories</h2><p class="paragraph center has--margin-40">Positive experiences shared by clients, partners and our community.</p></div><div class="is--slider-whole"><div class="slider-arrow-wrapper fade-up"><div class="slider-arrows"><a id="left-button" href="#" class="arrow-circle-link left inline-block"><div class="arrow-circle left"><img src="/images/Line-45.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="arrow-icon-left"></div></a><a id="right-button" href="#" class="arrow-circle-link inline-block"><div class="arrow-circle"><img src="/images/Line-45.svg" loading="lazy" width="20" alt="" class="arrow-icon-right"></div></a></div></div><div id="basic-swiper" class="testimonials-slider-collection is--success-stories list-wrapper"><div role="list" class="collection-list-8 swiper-wrapper is-succes--stories-list list-items"><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide list-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">Ted was extremely professional, personable and knows the law well. I hired Ted 2 years ago, and he handled my Personal Injury matter. I had previously worked with 4 lawyers. We went to trial and the defense attorney for Wholefoods had met his match. If you need representation I highly recommend Ted!</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-male-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Dr. Tom Bakman</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide list-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">Words simply cannot express how much I appreciate all of your efforts on my behalf before and during trial. Your gentlemanly professionalism was obvious to everyone in that courtroom. I am so pleased that your schedule allowed you to work on my case—and do such a splendid job!</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-female-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Patricia Heckhaus</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide list-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">I have known Ted for over 25 years and he has always been a hard-working and dedicated individual that I respect. Ted represented me in two cases and won both.</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-male-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Tom</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide list-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">I am really thankful for the effort…I will never forget your dedication towards this case. You always wanted to make sure I get the best from this. Thank you so much! I just told my parents…they are thanking you so much for the work you have done for our family!</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-male-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Karteek Koganti</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide list-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">My experience in this office was very pleasant, very good service, very attentive and friendly staff.</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-female-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Gabriella Juarez</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide list-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">Best lawyer I could ask for when it came to my car accident. Really fought to get to us what we needed and took care of our case.</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-female-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Brittney Vigil</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide list-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">Best lawyer you could need. Got my case settled in 6 months. I was able to be at home and recover and he took care of it.</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-male-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">John Vigil</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><Footer /><!-- Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->

